    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_ff6f77e8",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two dogs engaged in a physical altercation in a muddy environment. The overlaid text reads: 'ladies! if your man is offended by this he is a faggot end of story.' The meme uses the visual of dogs fighting as an analogy to suggest that men who are offended by such imagery are homosexual. This is a hateful meme because it employs a derogatory slur ('faggot') to attack and demean men who express discomfort with the depicted scene, thereby targeting individuals based on their sexual orientation. The intent is to shame and insult men who are perceived as 'weak' or 'unmanly' for being offended by the image, using a crude and offensive stereotype to enforce a particular social norm. The meme's overall intent is to provoke hostility and reinforce negative stereotypes about homosexuality by associating it with a perceived lack of masculinity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_41025c25"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
